<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 142 0 R
/E (A majority of respondents described the song as dramatic, intense, and emotionally powerful. Most participants reported experiencing a noticeable emotional shift while listening, indicating that the composition successfully altered or heightened their emotional state within a short duration. Even though the average listening time was approximately one minute, the song was still perceived as highly intense and memorable.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [1]
>>
