383 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 142 0 R
/E (Participants frequently connected the song to movies, dramatic situations, luxury or tech brands, and strong or bitter flavors such as coffee. This indicates cross-sensory association, where sound influences perception beyond hearing, extending into taste, brand identity, and spatial imagination.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
384 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 142 0 R
/E (Overall, the findings demonstrate that even a short exposure to a powerful musical piece can influence mood, trigger imagery, and create consistent patterns of perception among different individuals. The study highlights the strong psychological and sensory impact that music can have on human cognition and emotional processing.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [4]
>>
